[I] Libpcap-based tool that collect network traffic

[T] fprobe is a libpcap based tool that collects network traffic data and
[T] emits it as NetFlow flows towards a specified collector. It is useful
[T] for traffic accounting on hosts or routers without built-in NetFlow
[T] support.

[U] https://fprobe.sourceforge.net/

[A] Fprobe Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 1.1
[L] GPL

